<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber lowered its recommendation on Motorola Inc to attractive from buy, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/2 to 48-3/4.</p>
</text>
